Found when reviewing https://github.com/tidyverse/tibble/issues/1202. Not a blocker, just slows down subset assignment in this particular corner case.

``` r
vctrs::vec_as_subscript(1, arg = {
  print("bang")
})
#> [1] 1
vctrs::vec_as_subscript("a", arg = {
  print("bang")
})
#> [1] "a"
vctrs::vec_as_subscript(glue::glue("a"), arg = {
  print("bang")
})
#> [1] "bang"
#> [1] "a"
```

