#>   <bch:expr>                                <bch:tm> <bch:t>     <dbl> <bch:byt>
#> 1 rank(x, ties.method = "min")               246.1ms 262.1ms      3.81   30.55MB
#> 2 data.table::frank(x, ties.method = "min")   14.4ms  15.9ms     57.6     9.89MB
